                  "name": "t:names.text",
                  "settings": {
                    "class_name": "",
                    "text": "<p>Every uniform starts on paper, in our own studio — sketched, draped and sampled by hand, long before a single garment goes into production. Our design team works through fit, function and finish piece by piece, testing each one on real bodies before it ever reaches a production line.</p><p>There's no template to pull from and no factory overseas translating only a brief. Just our own team, in the same building, refining every detail until it's right. If something needs to change, it changes that day, not next season.</p><p>It means a uniform program that keeps evolving with the people wearing it, instead of asking them to make do.</p><p><strong>Our hands are marked by experience.</strong></p>",
